now But No One Ever Teaches You. Mix water, rinse aid, white vinegar and rubbing alcohol to keep fingerprints away from stainless steel and glass. This mix can also be used to make your shower screen sparkle. A mix of dish soap and baking soda is amazing to clean and deodorize your sink and drains. After you finish vacuuming, spray carpets with a linen spray for ongoing fragrance. And you can also make linen spray in Epsom salt scent bags for hidden fragrance throughout your home.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Education"}, {"shortCode": "DbaVAQaSnni", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbaVAQaSnni/", "caption": "Who else is guilty of having clean home and a messy car? \ud83d\ude4b\u200d\u2640\ufe0f I struggle to keep it clean with muddy footy boots, crumbs from after school snacks and extra jumpers for me and the kids (and at least 5 basketballs!)\ud83d\ude05 but this snippet was a great excuse to get up and give it a clean. Hope it\u2019s motivational for you too x  #carcleaning #cleanstagram", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:07:06.000Z", "videoDuration": 20, "videoPlayCount": 3675390, "videoViewCount": 1787824, "likesCount": 50853, "commentsCount": 312, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-fra5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/760522857_18102486257190993_930491404614764748_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gE3Fo75fM5ZwQvxIZzScU7Qjbf_mjPGlXpxYq9cmiGxMovTa1k9Yp2W5Sdy67Hutj0&_nc_ohc=uU5ZidNRbi0Q7kNvwEC4vEz&_nc_gid=TjTGq7Mh-kxAiv8wLjSXQg&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQEvhCFf47yq5yDcQSAxOGqLC3m-V0SNGeYwqUcrsDNb1A&oe=6A7E224E&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-fra5-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQOJoD8Q3rKqoG6q9YT-IzoJMM5nXSgX0A24xR5y7Vcbo28MjB4Oc5hjOv5v7lWtO5EsGoicdSwqekRpfuwc9sLp0zmJcCDSPLVnZ1Q.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=xTlrSeGfvwQQ7kNvwFMgl1d&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2h